dnuos (1.0.14-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Final release of the Python 2 version.
  * Fixed "Too many open files" failures in directories with more than
    about 500 audio files on Windows.
  * Fixed audio files with paths of 260 or more characters being
    silently skipped on Windows.
  * Fixed the dnuos script always exiting with status 0.
  * Fixed FLAC files shorter than one second failing with a division by
    zero.
  * The cache is rebuilt on first run.

 -- Josh Adams <xjoshx@gmail.com>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

